== Effects ==
* Spawns 2 {{e|Red Heart}}s on the ground near Isaac.

== Strategy ==
* Some {{r|Super Secret Room}} layouts can force hearts in them to be of one type. Using '''VI - The Lovers''' in these rooms can transform the red hearts into other types of hearts.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|n}}: Spawns {{dlc|nr}} 4 / {{dlc|r}} 3 {{e|Red Heart}}s.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth|n}} + {{i|Blank Card}} + {{i|Car Battery|n}} : Spawns {{dlc|nr}} 8 / {{dlc|r}} 6 Red Hearts.

== Trivia ==
[[wikipedia:The Lovers|The Lovers]] is the sixth card of a Major Arcana set.

